{"id":"conforme","lemma":"conforme","pos":"conj","rank":3209,"glosses":["as (varying through time to the same proportion that)"],"ipa":"/kõˈfɔɾ.mɨ/","examples":[{"text":"Tom fez isso conforme instruído.","en":"Tom did that as he was instructed to.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"learned"}]},{"text":"Age conforme sua idade.","en":"Try to act your age.","words":[{"g":"to do something","l":"agir"},null,{"g":"his","l":"seu"},{"g":"age"}]},{"text":"Ele agiu conforme havia dito que o faria.","en":"He did as he said he would do.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to do something","l":"agir"},null,{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"said"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"}]},{"text":"As coisas não saíram conforme o planejado.","en":"Things didn't go as intended.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/485052","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"thing","l":"coisa"},{"g":"not / no"},null,null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to plan","l":"planejar"}]},{"text":"Conforme foi crescendo, ela ficou cada vez mais bonita.","en":"As she grew older, she became more beautiful.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to grow","l":"crescer"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},null,null,null,{"g":"pretty, lovely","l":"bonito"}],"phrases":[[5,8,"more and more"]]}]}